  "body": "We're currently passing a script element's cryptographic nonce down\nthrough the loading mechanism to eventually generate a request that has\nits 'cryptographic nonce metadata' correctly populated.\n\nw3c/webappsec-csp#70 is going to add another property of the `<script>`\nelement, and piping another value through the whole chain, this patch\nchanges the flow to pass the element itself around. Values can be read\noff the element when generating the final request, simplifying the flow.\n",
